jobs.description:
We are looking for an experienced Full-Stack PHP/Laravel Developer to help us with a focused update to an existing B2B web platform.

The platform is already live and working. For this stage, we need help with a small set of improvements in one existing module rather than a full rebuild.

The tasks are:
- update several backend workflows in PHP/Laravel;
- fix an issue with data validation and status changes in the admin panel;
- improve one existing API Integration used to sync data with an external service;
- optimize several MySQL queries that are currently slowing down one dashboard;
- make a few minor JavaScript and HTML5 adjustments on the frontend;
- test the updated functionality and make sure existing features continue working correctly.

The main application uses PHP, Laravel, MySQL, JavaScript and standard Web Development practices. The wider product ecosystem also includes PostgreSQL and a small WordPress-based content section, so experience with those technologies would be useful for understanding the overall setup.

We are looking for someone comfortable working with an existing codebase, understanding business logic quickly, and making clean changes without unnecessary refactoring.
